Generated with pikto apply (decision and contact sheet in blackmath88/pikto docs/).
The repo already renders lucide-react; the three Unicode glyphs beside those icons now
use the same library instead of font-dependent characters: ArrowUpRight as the
hand-off marker on "Think with my AI" / "Think privately", MoveHorizontal in
.conflict-vs. Prose arrows (a → b, ${x} ↔ ${y}) stay text. The static prototype HTML is
left as is. .pikto/audit.json lets `pikto audit --check` catch new glyphs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C4YymvnQ8fu28LVdf3r7fR
